---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pulse Propulsion" description="How to reach light speed using Temporal Decoupling.">
  <article class="container" style="padding-top: 4rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1>Temporal Pulse Propulsion</h1>
    <p class="lead">Standard physics says the energy required to reach light speed is infinite. <strong>Temporal Decoupling</strong> says the energy is required to fight <em>time</em>. By pulsing our acceleration, we can reset that friction.</p>

    <!-- Interactive Simulation -->
    <div style="background: #0f172a; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 16px; margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;">
      
      <!-- FIX 1 & 2: display: block ensures width: 100% calculates correctly on all devices -->
      <canvas id="pulseCanvas" style="display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; height: 300px; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0 auto;"></canvas>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 1rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <button id="btnStandard" style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #334155; background: #1e293b; color: #fff;">Standard Drive</button>
        <button id="btnPulse" style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: #2563EB; color: white; border: none; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px;">Pulse Drive (Theory)</button>
        <button id="btnReset" style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #334155; background: #1e293b; color: #fff;">Reset</button>
      </div>
      <p id="statusText" style="color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; min-height: 1.5em;">Select a drive mode to compare efficiency.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>The Theory: Temporal Gearing</h2>
    <p>When a ship accelerates, it pushes against the "tide" of the timeline. As speed increases, this resistance (Temporal Drag) grows exponentially.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard Drive:</strong> Continuous acceleration fights the drag constantly. The ship gets stuck at 99% light speed because the energy required becomes infinite.</li>
      <li><strong>Pulse Drive:</strong> Accelerate → Stop (Coast) → Accelerate. During the "Coast" phase, the ship decouples from the timeline flow. Resistance drops to zero. The next pulse starts fresh, allowing the ship to "step" past the light barrier.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>

  <!-- FIX 3: is:inline prevents Astro's production bundler from altering the script execution -->
  <script is:inline>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      const canvas = document.getElementById('pulseCanvas');
      if (!canvas) return; // Safety check
      
      const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
      const btnStandard = document.getElementById('btnStandard');
      const btnPulse = document.getElementById('btnPulse');
      const btnReset = document.getElementById('btnReset');
      const statusText = document.getElementById('statusText');

      let animationId;
      let mode = 'none'; // 'standard' or 'pulse'
      let shipX = 50;
      let velocity = 0;

      // FIX 4: Dynamic resize handler keeps the canvas sharp on mobile rotation or desktop resize
      function resizeCanvas() {
        const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;
        const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
        canvas.width = rect.width * dpr;
        canvas.height = rect.height * dpr;
        ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);
        draw();
      }

      // Initial setup
      resizeCanvas();
      window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);

      function draw() {
        const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, rect.width, rect.height);
        
        // Draw Timeline (The "Substrate")
        ctx.fillStyle = '#1e293b';
        ctx.fillRect(0, 0, rect.width, rect.height);
        
        // Draw Grid
        ctx.strokeStyle = '#334155';
        ctx.lineWidth = 1;
        for(let i = 0; i < rect.width; i += 40) {
          ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(i, 0); ctx.lineTo(i, rect.height); ctx.stroke();
        }

        const lightSpeedLimit = rect.width - 50;

        // Draw Light Speed Barrier (The Wall)
        ctx.strokeStyle = '#ef4444';
        ctx.lineWidth = 3;
        ctx.setLineDash([5, 5]);
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.moveTo(lightSpeedLimit, 0);
        ctx.lineTo(lightSpeedLimit, rect.height);
        ctx.stroke();
        ctx.setLineDash([]);
        ctx.fillStyle = '#ef4444';
        ctx.font = '12px sans-serif';
        ctx.fillText('LIGHT SPEED BARRIER', lightSpeedLimit + 10, 20);

        // Draw Ship and Temporal Bulge
        if (mode !== 'none') {
          let isPushing = (mode === 'standard') || (mode === 'pulse' && (shipX % 150) < 100);
          
          // Visualize the Temporal Bulge (Time building up)
          if (isPushing && velocity > 0) {
            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3)'; // Soft blue glow
            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.ellipse(shipX + 15, rect.height / 2, 15, 8, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);
            ctx.fill();
            
            // Compressed flowlines in the bulge
            ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)';
            ctx.lineWidth = 1;
            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.moveTo(shipX + 10, rect.height / 2 - 5);
            ctx.lineTo(shipX + 25, rect.height / 2);
            ctx.lineTo(shipX + 10, rect.height / 2 + 5);
            ctx.stroke();
          }

          // The Ship
          ctx.fillStyle = '#3b82f6';
          ctx.beginPath();
          ctx.arc(shipX, rect.height / 2, 10, 0, Math.PI * 2);
          ctx.fill();
          
          // Exhaust (only visible when pushing)
          if (velocity > 0) {
             ctx.fillStyle = isPushing ? '#f59e0b' : 'transparent';
             ctx.fillRect(shipX - 15, rect.height/2 - 3, 10, 6);
          }
        }

        // Draw Graph (Resistance)
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.strokeStyle = '#10b981';
        ctx.lineWidth = 2;
        for (let x = 0; x < rect.width; x++) {
          let y = rect.height - (x / rect.width) * (rect.height * 0.8);
          if (x > rect.width * 0.6) y += Math.pow((x - rect.width * 0.6) / 100, 2) * 50;
          if (x === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);
          else ctx.lineTo(x, y);
        }
        ctx.stroke();
        
        ctx.fillStyle = '#10b981';
        ctx.fillText('TEMPORAL RESISTANCE (Drag)', 10, rect.height - 10);
      }

      function update() {
        const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
        const lightSpeedLimit = rect.width - 50;

        if (mode === 'standard') {
          if (shipX < lightSpeedLimit) {
            let drag = Math.pow(velocity / 2, 3); 
            let thrust = 0.5;
            if (drag < thrust) {
               velocity += thrust - drag;
               shipX += velocity;
            } else {
               statusText.innerText = "Standard Drive: Stuck at 99% Light Speed. Resistance is too high.";
               statusText.style.color = "#ef4444";
            }
          }
        } else if (mode === 'pulse') {
           let cyclePos = shipX % 150;
           
           if (cyclePos < 100) {
             // Pushing phase
             let drag = Math.pow(velocity / 3, 2);
             let thrust = 1.0;
             if (drag < thrust) {
                velocity += thrust - drag;
                shipX += velocity;
                statusText.innerText = "Pulse Drive: Accelerating. Drag is managed.";
                statusText.style.color = "#10b981";
             }
           } else {
             // Coasting phase (Decoupled)
             velocity = 0;
             shipX += 2; // Drift forward
             statusText.innerText = "Pulse Drive: Coasting (Decoupled). Resistance reset to 0.";
             statusText.style.color = "#3b82f6";
           }
        }

        if (shipX > lightSpeedLimit) {
           statusText.innerText = "SUCCESS: Pulse Drive broke the Light Speed Barrier!";
           statusText.style.color = "#f59e0b";
           mode = 'none';
        }

        draw();
        if (mode !== 'none') {
          animationId = requestAnimationFrame(update);
        }
      }

      btnStandard.addEventListener('click', () => {
        reset();
        mode = 'standard';
        update();
      });

      btnPulse.addEventListener('click', () => {
        reset();
        mode = 'pulse';
        update();
      });

      btnReset.addEventListener('click', reset);

      function reset() {
        mode = 'none';
        shipX = 50;
        velocity = 0;
        statusText.innerText = "Select a drive mode.";
        statusText.style.color = "#94a3b8";
        draw();
        cancelAnimationFrame(animationId);
      }
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>